<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="c056bdf">&lt;p&gt;
    The purpose of this artifact is to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Demonstrate to stakeholders how the various technical requirements will be addressed by the solution.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communicate the end-to-end story of how a proposed solution will work.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Serve as a key reference guide for completing the detailed design and build of the proposed solution.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="30739638"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="4d2d1d7b"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="6fb7482f">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Solution blueprint&lt;/strong&gt;: Provides the high level view of the solution either using a landscape diagram
        or an enhanced vision diagram.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Solution overview&lt;/strong&gt;: Provides the list of solution specific technical requirements (e.g., interface
        requirements, integration requirements, data requirements, reporting requirements etc.) that must be addressed by
        the solution.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Solution integration scope and approach&lt;/strong&gt;: Explains the scope of the integration of the solution
        with the given environment along with details about the type of integration required between each component and the
        solution.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Solution integration views&lt;/strong&gt;: Additional views that might be created to illustrate the solution to
        various stakeholders.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
